{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1440.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"cfd36f49830e759a8a4c04f4a34d88c1fbd764c24523bf7a3c33e9b3cbdfb85a","ja":"不意打ちのエチュード","zh":"突如袭来的练习曲","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1440.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"c293b77d04583cbbbed718d1d3f882777db506e4f08b2385fae6294854e13dd7","ja":"「これより、この10名で最終選考を始めますが、\n事前の通達と審査内容を変更します」","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1440.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"be1df6581844ca6de4e3498ad7085e34b490bcd8165f32365d6455170e0b0b11","ja":"「新たな審査内容は……エチュードです！\nお題は『勝負』。それでは、始めてください」","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1440.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"d8554b7f8f6d0d6dd65ee437001a40d0044a359a8ac58e5a097978b9a073ee1a","ja":"なあなあ、千鶴。\n『エチュード』って、なんだ？","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1440.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"0912e88fb05e128b619a1836579bb3cddf6ae9d180c8f7877ca2c03a0991deb0","ja":"『即興劇』の事ですわ。\nアドリブの演技力を審査するみたいですわね。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1440.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"85aed877917f402eb964e31264291d2c395695ab7000b68dabd299e59494166d","ja":"「えっ？　エチュード……って、\nそんな、いきなり……」","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1440.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"f60c911667d20399d0d6a30f24587339c917b8115b228fed47af6af8a02b2b52","ja":"（急に審査内容が変わって、\nみんな戸惑ってるな……よーしっ！）","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1440.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"22adfeb0eaac9ad2e8d58d75198cec3adc19c9d24b3659fdbe00a555a8d47f4e","ja":"「やっとまた戦えるな！\nマウンドの雪辱は、マウンドで晴らさせてもらうぜ！」","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1440.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"087264cfc6e5919b89619535ed884432501932abc7eece20835890e6615f3697","ja":"（さすがですわね、昴。\nわたくしも負けてはいられませんわ！）","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1440.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"82c1ee155785b14fb0af74c3ecea84f6fdf955d19fbbdf4d0ce81fb4d3a1bc92","ja":"「……誰よりも真っ先に吠える威勢は認めてやろう。\nだが、何度やろうとも結果は同じ……」","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1440.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"8cd1c55710a29a2cfdae7c69eb2fc9ca32bb2022b7f8ab290e0400ed2bb5e026","ja":"「今年も優勝を逃して、\nマウンドを去る惨めな姿を晒すだけだ！」","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1440.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"6c737dfdff53419072f692ec3cc589434a0e84991e5dfa22cf0b351d1e66d776","ja":"「そんなの、やってみないとわからないだろ！\nオレたちは勝つ、最高のチームで、最強のチームに！」","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1440.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"07bf36575428e469c13cce4ce76eff65c88c4e9c8029b836ced6cbb4b58990bf","ja":"「ふっ……そこまで言うのなら、かかってくるがいい！\n二度と立ち上がれないよう叩きのめして……」","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1440.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"1d58b86fc5d76bec835a4d1bfc94ea0984b6df3f99ab18de4ca2016c00b4c3df","ja":"「……ま、待って！」","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1440.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"832a8fca5499e4327674aee6db7a095a06a4799aa1cd235e8efcad5da08ced4c","ja":"（他の方も入ってきてくださいましたわね。\nどんなふうにお芝居を広げていただけるのか……）","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1440.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"9bab101fd70752dee4b5ba40381fe47cd05ad8a0bc3ff01c62831c8fd74fa41c","ja":"「お、お願い、もうやめて、ふたりとも！\n私のために争わないで！！」","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
